<body style="height: auto; min-height: auto;">Ref No: {{{Case.Case_Number__c}}}<br />
<br />
Hi {{{Case.First_Name__c}}},<br />
<br />
As a valued Qantas customer travelling with a Service Dog, we invite you to complete our Service Dog Application Form to ensure we always have your details and agreement to our Service Dogs Condition of Carriage on file.<br />
<br />
This form is valid for all future travel and you only need to complete it once, provided you inform us if there is any material change in your circumstances or those of your Service Dog, such as the dog has retired due to age or illness.<br />
<br />
Completing the form in advance of any upcoming travel will enable a more seamless experience next time you choose to fly Qantas.<br />
<br />
Our Service Dog Application Form can be accessed via this link: <a href="https://www.qantas.com/content/dam/qantas/pdfs/fly/specific-needs/service-dogs/qantas-service-dogs-form.pdf">https://www.qantas.com/content/dam/qantas/pdfs/fly/specific-needs/service-dogs/qantas-service-dogs-form.pdf</a><br />
<br />
If you have any questions, please let us know or visit our <a href="https://www.qantas.com/au/en/travel-info/specific-needs/travelling-with-specific-needs/service-dogs.html">Service Dogs</a>&nbsp;webpage.</body>
</html>